    "detailed_description": "Fairytale Furnishing is a game about interior designing and furnishing homes for fairy tale heroes. Customize the princess's tower, the hero's cabin, or the witch's cottage to your taste. Unlock new items. Revisit completed locations to decorate them differently. In the process, uncover the story that connects the characters with each other.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Furnish:</h2><br>Across game levels, you'll find yourself in the empty abodes of fairy tale characters - like a princess's tower or a witch's den. You'll furnish their homes, placing furniture and other items, thereby better revealing the personalities of their owners. Don't worry - the game doesn't rush you or challenge you with difficult tasks - just enjoy furnishing the homes at your leisure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895090/extras/d0c5edcd9720d0e706cfb5cbc438ab05.poster.avif?t=1722548821\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895090/extras/d0c5edcd9720d0e706cfb5cbc438ab05.webm?t=1722548821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895090/extras/d0c5edcd9720d0e706cfb5cbc438ab05.mp4?t=1722548821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock:</h2><br>As you furnish, you'll be able to unlock new items to create more original interiors. Over time, you'll get acquainted with the story and unlock the next level, so you can move on whenever you wish.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895090/extras/7a4fd7f39698633895940c57852d0ff1.poster.avif?t=1722548821\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895090/extras/7a4fd7f39698633895940c57852d0ff1.webm?t=1722548821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895090/extras/7a4fd7f39698633895940c57852d0ff1.mp4?t=1722548821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose:</h2><br>Fairytale Furnishing is a relaxing sandbox game with story elements. This means you can jump into any of the levels you've previously unlocked at any moment and start from the last save. You can rearrange, remove, and place new items. You can even clear a level and start it over to furnish it in a completely different way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895090/extras/d120a9ed879f58ee4830dfc5de564df0.poster.avif?t=1722548821\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895090/extras/d120a9ed879f58ee4830dfc5de564df0.webm?t=1722548821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895090/extras/d120a9ed879f58ee4830dfc5de564df0.mp4?t=1722548821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smile:</h2><br>In this tale, there's a beautiful princess, an evil witch, a brave hero, and a stern king - seems straightforward, right? But the plot isn't as clich\u00e9d as it might seem - this world also has (wireless) internet, and the characters may not be who they seem to be.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895090/extras/72d1eed09428991d80a8cdf76209185c.poster.avif?t=1722548821\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895090/extras/72d1eed09428991d80a8cdf76209185c.webm?t=1722548821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895090/extras/72d1eed09428991d80a8cdf76209185c.mp4?t=1722548821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Enjoy the game!",
