0/extras/7a4fd7f39698633895940c57852d0ff1.webm?t=1722548821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895090/extras/7a4fd7f39698633895940c57852d0ff1.mp4?t=1722548821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose:</h2><br>Fairytale Furnishing is a relaxing sandbox game with story elements. This means you can jump into any of the levels you've previously unlocked at any moment and start from the last save. You can rearrange, remove, and place new items. You can even clear a level and start it over to furnish it in a completely different way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895090/extras/d120a9ed879f58ee4830dfc5de564df0.poster.avif?t=1722548821\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895090/extras/d120a9ed879f58ee4830dfc5de564df0.webm?t=1722548821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895090/extras/d120a9ed879f58ee4830dfc5de564df0.mp4?t=1722548821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smile:</h2><br>In this tale, there's a beautiful princess, an evil witch, a brave hero, and a stern king - seems straightforward, right? But the plot isn't as clich\u00e9d as it might seem - this world also has (wireless) internet, and the characters may not be who they seem to be.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895090/extras/72d1eed09428991d80a8cdf76209185c.poster.avif?t=1722548821\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895090/extras/72d1eed09428991d80a8cdf76209185c.webm?t=1722548821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895090/extras/72d1eed09428991d80a8cdf76209185c.mp4?t=1722548821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Enjoy the game!",
